ent.ts:59:    // Verify SELECT WHERE id::text LIKE '00000000-%' returns exactly 3 rows\ntests/synthetics/test_known_ids.py:121:        not SQL `WHERE id::text LIKE '00000000-%'`.\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-crawler-agent.runner.log:27:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-crawler-agent.runner.log:42:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-crawler-agent.state-machine.log:23:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-scoring-agent.cache-verification.log:23:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-scoring-agent.cache-verification.log:25:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-scoring-agent.cache-verification.log:30:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-scoring-agent.cache-verification.log:46:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-scoring-agent.cache-verification.log:49:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-scoring-agent.cache-verification.log:54:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-scoring-agent.cache-verification.log:57:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-scoring-agent.cache-verification.log:62:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-scoring-agent.cache-verification.log:67:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T03-38-17-672Z/synthetics-crawler-agent.schemas.log:31:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T04-33-41-260Z/synthetics-fix-agent.scoring-runner-detection.log:33:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T04-33-41-260Z/synthetics-fix-agent.scoring-runner-detection.log:34:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T04-33-41-260Z/synthetics-fix-agent.scoring-runner-detection.log:37:[Omitted long matching line]\nlogs/2026-05-28T04-33-41-260Z/synthetics-fix-agent.scoring-runner-detection.lo